  "summary_en": "Japanese 2019 practical guide, funded by MHLW and produced by Mitsubishi Research Institute, on introducing nursing-care robots in care facilities. It covers 13 METI/MHLW priority device categories, costs, environment, safety cautions, case studies, and a staged adoption and evaluation process, plus subsidy contacts.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Describes 13 priority care-robot categories (transfer, mobility, excretion, monitoring, bathing, care-work support) with selection checklists",
