   "Stresses user and staff safety first; stop use if danger is sensed; select suitable users",
   "Advises privacy explanation to families for camera/sensor monitoring and information security for cloud data",
   "Lists prefectural subsidy contacts for care-robot introduction support under the Regional Medical and Care Fund"
